  "body": "Present your offer — the vendor is ready to sell.\r\n\r\nAt $1,290,000, this is where size, specification and value come together.\r\n\r\nSet on a 408m² freehold section with approximately 228m² of brand-new living, this substantial 5-bedroom home delivers something increasingly difficult to find in a new build: genuine family space.\r\n\r\nTwo living areas. A proper backyard. Double internal garaging. A downstairs ensuite bedroom. Premium comfort throughout. And importantly, enough room for a growing or extended family to live without constantly getting in each other's way.\r\n\r\nThe Numbers Speak for Themselves\r\n\r\n• Now asking $1,290,000\r\n\r\n• 408m² freehold section — considerably more outdoor space than many new builds\r\n\r\n• Approx. 228m² floor area across two generous levels\r\n\r\n• 5 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms\r\n\r\n• 2 separate living areas\r\n\r\n• Double internal-access garage\r\n\r\n• Built by Mars Living Construction\r\n\r\n• Downstairs bedroom with ensuite — ideal for grandparents, guests, teenagers or working from home\r\n\r\n• Upstairs family lounge with direct connection to the outdoor entertaining area and backyard\r\n\r\n• Central air-conditioning with individual room controls\r\n\r\n• Underfloor heating in bathrooms\r\n\r\n• Bosch kitchen appliances\r\n\r\n• Brand new and ready for immediate enjoyment\r\n\r\nBuilt for a Family That Needs Real Space\r\n\r\nForget squeezing five bedrooms into a compact footprint.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor gives the household genuine flexibility, with a private ensuite bedroom, spacious everyday living, a well-appointed kitchen and double internal-access garaging. Extended family can stay comfortably, teenagers can have independence, or the room can become a dedicated office without sacrificing the rest of the home.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the second family lounge creates another valuable living zone and opens directly to the outdoor entertaining area and backyard.\r\n\r\nIt is a layout designed around how families actually live — children in one space, adults in another, guests staying over, and everyone still having room to breathe.\r\n\r\nMore Than Just Square Metres\r\n\r\nThe specification has been designed for everyday comfort.\r\n\r\nCentral air-conditioning with individual room controls allows different parts of the household to set their own temperature, while underfloor bathroom heating makes winter mornings considerably more comfortable.\r\n\r\nBosch kitchen appliances, modern finishes and a brand-new construction mean you can move in and enjoy the home from day one — without inheriting the maintenance list that often comes with an older property.\r\n\r\n$1,290,000 — Now Is the Time to Make Your Move\r\n\r\nThere are plenty of new builds on the market.\r\n\r\nThere are far fewer offering approximately 228m² of floor area, 408m² of freehold land, five bedrooms, two living areas, a genuine backyard and double garaging at this price point.\r\n\r\nThe vendor is serious about selling.\r\n\r\nNow asking $1,290,000 — present your offer.\r\n\r\nContact Lisa on 021 877 067 today to arrange your viewing.",
